{"id": "De4fD4_S0q7", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Kuch log jaate hain toh sirf ghar nahi chhodte… poore gaon ko adhoora chhod jaate hain 🥀\n\nKal subah woh is gaon se vida ho jaayegi.\nJhoola khaali hilta rahega. Tulsi ka diya akela jalega. Aangan ki rangoli aadhi hi reh jaayegi, aur pagdandi pe uske alta ke laal nishaan har baarish ke saath thode aur mit jaayenge.\n\nDeewar pe baitha woh ladka ab bhi wahi raasta dekhta hai… us chidiya ke saath, jo kabhi uski khidki pe baithti thi.\n\nIs reel mein har cheez sirf ek lakeer hai, adhoori si. Sirf woh poori hai… kyunki uske bina is gaon mein kuch bhi poora nahi lagta 🤍\n\n🎵 Bade Achhe Lagte Hain · Amit Kumar · R.D. Burman · Anand Bakshi (Balika Badhu, 1976)\n\nUsko bhejo jiske jaane ke baad aangan aaj bhi khaali lagta hai\n\nBade Achhe Lagte Hain | Bade Achhe Lagte Hain animation | Amit Kumar songs | R.D. Burman songs | Anand Bakshi songs | Balika Badhu song | old Hindi songs | emotional Hindi songs | 70s Bollywood songs | village love story | chalk animation | animated music video\n\n#BadeAchheLagteHain #AmitKumar #RDBurman #OldHindiSongs #ChalkAnimation", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792856838, "like_count": 866, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2091464914823440a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 46.823, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMUIq1unyyg2JZs14AgCge8FkGBGh4e3rQW0SPfxhswTjQVyCtKWszVNlpHSz1_SV4fe3Pf04_9QoWGmeRq-K1BGKF7kVefazxA9O0.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdrOoxtX7yniCOID4EzZmkxvIj9Fr2YLhj1o8K6bKIzfAAMCCMtOVSvJpP3kXWZpmz5wtZzWN0e9a3k3GNcctFL_&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=GUZM-CZzKi0Q7kNvwEuPWln&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=LTN3IIe6YpkKkeuLdHANeg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_buc